{"product_id":"haud-ma-chips-ahve-drapped-the-wean-copy","title":"Discovering Poetry: A Poetry Course for Key Stage 3","description":"\u003cdiv class=\"synopsis-body\"\u003eThis introduction to poetry provides over 100 thematically grouped poems in a variety of styles from Australian bush songs to highly crafted sonnets, including limericks, ballads, legends, haiku and poetry on contemporary issues. Activities such as discussions, games and performances help students understand the meaning, form and language of poetry and reinforce the main message of the book - that poetry is fun!\u003c\/div\u003e\n\u003cp class=\"block\" id=\"synopsis-disclaimer-text\"\u003e\u003cem\u003e\"synopsis\" may belong to another edition of this title.\u003c\/em\u003e\u003c\/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr\u003eDimensions:14 x 200 \u003cbr\u003eAuthor: Denise Scott\u003cbr\u003eISBN: 9780435140427\u003cbr\u003eFormat: \u003cbr\u003ePages 154\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookhero.ae","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":44698341900441,"sku":"15RD-1-9780435140427","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/poetry.jpg?v=1722441772","url":"https:\/\/bookhero.ae\/products\/haud-ma-chips-ahve-drapped-the-wean-copy","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}